== start.sh auto-update logic (paths redirected to /tmp, real download from our mirror)
good URL -> FROM=mirror-at-start, sha256 09033c27...a584841 (the current mirror-robin tarball)
404 URL  -> 'robin: newest copy not usable; keeping the copy built into the image', FROM=image

